   "tag": "aside"
  },
  {
   "children": [
    "A working paper written on 2026-10-17, published nearly as written. Local file paths, private repository names and personal names have been removed."
   ],
   "tag": "blockquote"
  },
  {
   "children": [
    "Hamilton is split across four conservation authorities: HCA, NPCA, GRCA and Conservation Halton (CH). The City's dissolved CA watershed layers name each parcel's regulator."
   ],
   "tag": "p"
  },
  {
   "children": [
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "HCA"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " — Regulation-limit source: HCA open data (Regulated Areas) · Status: catalogued, reviewed_context"
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "NPCA"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " — Regulation-limit source: NPCA ArcGIS Online · Status: catalogued"
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "GRCA"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " — Regulation-limit source: Region of Waterloo ITS-GIS proxy: ",
      {
       "children": [
        "_GRCA_Regulatory/MapServer/2"
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      },
      " · Status: ",
      {
       "children": [
        "trial pull done, see below"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      }
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "Conservation Halton"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " — Regulation-limit source: ",
      {
       "children": [
        "no open endpoint found"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " · Status: ",
      {
       "children": [
        "named gap."
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " Options: request the layer from CH, or give CH-area parcels a named refusal"
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    }
   ],
   "tag": "ul"
  },
  {
   "attrs": {
    "id": "GRCA-trial-pull"
   },
   "children": [
    "GRCA trial pull"
   ],
   "tag": "h3"
  },
  {
   "children": [
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "Source:"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " https://utility.arcgis.com/usrsvcs/servers/7816f003cfd74d6591ccc5023a62b230/rest/services/_GRCA_Regulatory/MapServer/2. \"Regulation Limits (GRCA)\", Ontario Regulation 150/06. The copyright text says GRCA; the service is hosted by Region of Waterloo ITS-GIS. Native CRS is EPSG:26917."
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "Clip:"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " Hamilton ",
      {
       "children": [
        "City_Boundary/FeatureServer/13"
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      },
      ". Envelope query, then exact intersection and clip."
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "Pulled:"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " 2026-10-17 01:47 ET."
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "Stored (local, outside git):"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " a local working copy"
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "grca_regulation_limits_hamilton_clipped.geojson"
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      },
      " (EPSG:4326, 6.4 MB)"
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "raw/"
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      }
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "PULL-SUMMARY.json"
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      }
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "Features:"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      }
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      "199 intersect Hamilton, all ",
      {
       "children": [
        "GR_FEATURE = REGULATION LIMIT"
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      },
      "."
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      "By ",
      {
       "children": [
        "MU_LTIER"
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      },
      ": 187 City of Hamilton, 9 County of Brant, 3 North Dumfries. The neighbour polygons straddle the boundary and are clipped."
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      "The layer has 188 features tagged Hamilton in total; one of them does not touch the boundary."
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "Fields:"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " OBJECTID, MU_UTIER, MU_LTIER, GR_FEATURE, REG_NUMBER, CREATION_DATE, LAST_REVISION_DATE, crcValue, GlobalID. There are no owner or personal fields. The script now uses ",
      {
       "children": [
        "outFields=*"
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      },
      " (all fields); the stored pull already holds every field."
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "Coverage:"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " 49.37 km² regulated, or 4.3% of Hamilton's 1,148.8 km² (regulated area only, not the whole GRCA watershed)."
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "Vintage:"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " CREATION_DATE 2006-04-20; LAST_REVISION_DATE 2026-06-28 on all features. The layer has no editingInfo."
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "Caveat:"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " Esri rings were assembled into polygons by symmetric difference. Spot-check holes before relying on exact areas."
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    }
   ],
